[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3955266003","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116717#issuecomment-3955266003","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116717","id":3955266003,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7rwJHT","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-24T23:16:46Z","updated_at":"2026-02-24T23:16:46Z","body":"Also reproducible in 4.5 and 4.4 stable","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3955266003/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3958370577","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116717#issuecomment-3958370577","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116717","id":3958370577,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7r7_ER","user":{"login":"wjt","id":86760,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86760?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt","html_url":"https://github.com/wjt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-25T10:45:05Z","updated_at":"2026-02-25T10:45:05Z","body":"I think I understand the problem now.\n\n`set_clip_count` is being excluded from the completion list by this block:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/15a4311583fbaad2eee5d2ecda5437eb9fd68c63/core/object/class_db.cpp#L953-L955\n\nThis is because `set_clip_count` is the setter associated with the `clip_count` property. This makes some sense to exclude: `clip_count` is in the completion list. (I would argue that there are cases where you do want to use the setter explicitly, e.g. passing `stream.set_clip_count` as a `Callback`, but it's an edge case.)\n\n`set_clip_name` is excluded for the same reason: it is the setter for a property. In fact it is the setter for 63 properties, such as `clip_23/name`:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/15a4311583fbaad2eee5d2ecda5437eb9fd68c63/modules/interactive_music/audio_stream_interactive.cpp#L486-L491\n\nThe property `clip_23/name` is also excluded from the completion list because its name contains a slash:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/15a4311583fbaad2eee5d2ecda5437eb9fd68c63/modules/gdscript/gdscript_editor.cpp#L1379-L1385\n\nThis makes sense in isolation because `stream.clip_23/name` is syntactically invalid; but the result is bad because there is no completion for either of the ways to set the name of a clip.\n\nI tried completing the property names in a statement like this, where `|` indicates the cursor position where I hit <kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>Space</kbd>:\n\n```gdscript\nvar stream := AudioStreamInteractive.new()\nstream[\"|\"]\n```\n\nNone of the `clip_%i/*` properties are offered in the completion list here either. I have not diagnosed why not.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3958370577/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3958407007","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116717#issuecomment-3958407007","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116717","id":3958407007,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7r8H9f","user":{"login":"wjt","id":86760,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86760?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt","html_url":"https://github.com/wjt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-25T10:51:48Z","updated_at":"2026-02-25T10:51:48Z","body":"The following patch excludes getters/setters from `methods_in_properties` if it is an indexed property, and solves my immediate problem:\n\n```diff\ndiff --git a/core/object/class_db.cpp b/core/object/class_db.cpp\nindex 80a89787c1..b5bece463c 100644\n--- a/core/object/class_db.cpp\n+++ b/core/object/class_db.cpp\n@@ -1539,10 +1539,10 @@\n        type->property_list.push_back(p_pinfo);\n        type->property_map[p_pinfo.name] = p_pinfo;\n #ifdef DEBUG_ENABLED\n-       if (mb_get) {\n+       if (mb_get && p_index < 0) {\n                type->methods_in_properties.insert(p_getter);\n        }\n-       if (mb_set) {\n+       if (mb_set && p_index < 0) {\n                type->methods_in_properties.insert(p_setter);\n        }\n #endif // DEBUG_ENABLED\n```\n\nA more involved option here would be to change:\n\n```cpp\nvoid ClassDB::get_method_list(const StringName &p_class, List<MethodInfo> *p_methods, bool p_no_inheritance, bool p_exclude_from_properties) {\n```\n\nso that the last parameter is an enum:\n\n- Exclude all methods that are getters/setters\n- Exclude methods that are getters/setters for property names that don't have `/` in them\n- Don't exclude getters/setters\n\nor have the completion code pass `false` in the existing `p_exclude_from_properties` and do its own `/`-based filtering. Not sure what the right approach is here.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3958407007/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3958412266","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116717#issuecomment-3958412266","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116717","id":3958412266,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7r8JPq","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-25T10:52:40Z","updated_at":"2026-02-25T11:12:48Z","body":"Wouldn't consider this a bug, these properties are internal for the purpose of serialization, and I'd say configuring the object should be done with the methods, no different from `TileMapLayer`, `Animation`, etc.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3958412266/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"outdated"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3958431976","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116717#issuecomment-3958431976","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116717","id":3958431976,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7r8ODo","user":{"login":"wjt","id":86760,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86760?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt","html_url":"https://github.com/wjt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-25T10:55:29Z","updated_at":"2026-02-25T10:55:29Z","body":"Sure! But the methods don't appear in Ctrl+Space autocompletion.\n\n`Environment.set_glow_level()` for example has the same problem, because `Environment` has properties `glow_levels/1` through `glow_levels/7`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3958431976/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]